742
01:17:03,446 --> 01:17:04,620
Vire devagar.

743
01:17:06,069 --> 01:17:07,899
Isso mesmo, devagar.

744
01:17:07,899 --> 01:17:09,107
Gire mais devagar.

745
01:17:11,143 --> 01:17:12,731
Gire mais devagar.

